  "Title": "Op-Amp Comparator",
  "Description": "Open-loop operational amplifier voltage comparator with dual split DC supply (+15V, -15V, middle GND reference), reference voltage Vref = 2.0V on inverting input (-), input signal Vin = 3.5V on non-inverting input (+), open-loop gain saturating output to positive supply rail (+15.0V), and 10 kOhm load.",
